shouldn't be the difference because it's the same driver).

(And while I'm at it, either I'm senile, or the serial cable is no longer
behaving as before, because now I don't get any output on a minicom at the
other side, the keypresses on the client just cause the Sun machine to go
into PROM, which shows up on the RSC if configured, otherwise nowhere.
It's annoying as hell to debug... I'm beginning to think it's best to dump
this machine completely and get rid of its quirks...)

